-	 * packet layout the 0150/0190 decoders verified (type = h >> 28), dumps
-	 * the 32 raw dwords around the stop point first, and reads REM twice so
-	 * "stuck" is distinguishable from "slow".
+	 * 0255: 0254 still fired on the first kick, before any IB had been handed
